ValeVision3D - overspill note regions: the record, the model, and where every note goes

  The record (the shipped SheetRecords and its NoteRegions leaf)
  PASS  a margin record with no regions gains no key
  PASS  RegionsOn false and an empty list are both dropped
  PASS  regions are kept with the switch off, so switching on puts them back
