  The model (the shipped Sheets unit)
  PASS  Add on a sheet with no margin record makes one, margin OFF, regions ON
  PASS  ...announced once as margin
  PASS  a silent update moves the frame, keeps what it was not given, announces nothing
  PASS  groups tick and untick one at a time; the sides given change; the title and overspill are set
  PASS  ...each an announced step
  PASS  an empty title goes back to the automatic one
  PASS  updating a region the sheet does not have does nothing
  PASS  the switch off drops RegionsOn and keeps both regions
  PASS  deleting the last region drops the list and leaves the switch on
  PASS  deleting one that is not there does nothing

  Where every note goes (the shipped SpecMargin, Column and NoteRegions)
  PASS  no regions: the margin lists every note, and what does not fit is overflow as before
  PASS  regions kept with the switch off change nothing
  PASS  the sheet lists its linked notes first and its general notes last
